     "<div role=\"region\" aria-labelledby=\"c231\">\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<div>\r\n<font face=\".AppleSystemUIFont\"><span style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\">Hi </span>D-RUG<span style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\">gies! </span><br></font></div><div><font face=\".AppleSystemUIFont\"><br></font></div><div><font face=\".AppleSystemUIFont\">We&#39;ll be meeting from 10-noon in the Datalab classroom (360 \r\nShields library) this week. This is a group working session so come with your \r\nquestions for our expeRts, or just bring your laptop\r\n and get in some distraction free R-coding time. This is a hybrid \r\nmeeting so you can also join us via Zoom at this link: <a href=\"https://ucdavis.zoom.us/j/96397082218?pwd=S0JXcW5hcUFkbTcwMHFQV1NVNkg3Zz09\" title=\"https://ucdavis.zoom.us/j/96397082218?pwd=S0JXcW5hcUFkbTcwMHFQV1NVNkg3Zz09\" style=\"color:rgb(0,134,240)\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://ucdavis.zoom.us/j/96397082218?pwd%3DS0JXcW5hcUFkbTcwMHFQV1NVNkg3Zz09&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792464604899000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0MtvdAX5_-it-69fl6YJM3\">https://ucdavis.zoom.us/j/96397082218?pwd=S0JXcW5hcUFkbTcwMHFQV1NVNkg3Zz09</a> <br></font></div><div><font face=\".AppleSystemUIFont\"><br></font></div><div><font face=\".AppleSystemUIFont\">As a heads up, next week the DataLab will be hosting the first in a two part series on <a href=\"https://datalab.ucdavis.edu/eventscalendar/workshop-machine-learning-in-r-clustering-and-classification-part-1-of-2/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://datalab.ucdavis.edu/eventscalendar/workshop-machine-learning-in-r-clustering-and-classification-part-1-of-2/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792464604899000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3C65cgVfj-pGEi99U2Mi3N\">Machine Learning in R</a>. This is a great way to get into the nuts and bolts of machine learning, with lots of hands on examples. <br></font>\r\n<div><font face=\".AppleSystemUIFont\"><br>\r\n</font></div>\r\n<div><font face=\".AppleSystemUIFont\">Please consider posting your questions to our <a href=\"https://d-rug.discourse.group/\" title=\"https://d-rug.discourse.group/\" style=\"color:rgb(0,134,240)\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://d-rug.discourse.group/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792464604899000&amp;usg=AOvVaw29QTHOt8f4_F26F1hJCHoo\">Discourse</a> site in advance of attending D-RUG virtually. This\r\n helps us do a better job of answering your questions, and also keep a log of the types of questions we see frequently.</font></div>\r\n<div><font face=\".AppleSystemUIFont\"><br>\r\n</font></div>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0px\"><font color=\"#1d1d1d\" style=\"line-height:1.2\" face=\".AppleSystemUIFont\">See you then,</font></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0px\"><font color=\"#1d1d1d\" style=\"line-height:1.2\" face=\".AppleSystemUIFont\">Your D-RUG Coo[R]dinators </font></p>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n</div>"
